# Vosk models

Mirror of the models listed on
[vosk models](https://alphacephei.com/vosk/models) ("Vosk Speech
Recognition Models") plus the extras found in the
[Derur mirror](https://huggingface.co/Derur/vosk-models/tree/main/stt)
(union of both sources), kept as the **original zips** exactly as the
site ships them.  Only the **ASR models** are mirrored (no speaker-id or
text models); each language lives in its own folder under
[`asr/<lang>/`](asr) (e.g. `asr/cn/`), holding the model's zip and,
next to it, an info page listing the files inside the zip.

Model folders contain (see the model's info page for the exact files):

| entry | what it is |
|---|---|
| `am/` | acoustic model (`final.mdl`; some models ship extras) |
| `conf/` | configs: `mfcc.conf`, `model.conf`, ... |
| `graph/` | decoding graph (`HCLG.fst`, or `HCLr.fst` + `Gr.fst` for small models) |
| `ivector/` | i-vector extractor (speaker adaptation) |
| `rescore/`, `rnnlm/` | rescoring / RNNLM extras (large models only) |
| `README` | model notes |

